  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> Training (1) in Ranged Weapons</p><p>You rain down a hail of projectiles on a group of enemies.</p><p>Choose a point within your weapon’s range and make a <strong>4:1</strong> <strong>Body (Ranged Weapons)</strong> Check.</p><p>Each creature within a <strong>5-space-radius</strong> of that point must make an <strong>4:S</strong> <strong>Reflexes </strong>Check, where <strong>S</strong> is equal to the number of successes you achieved.</p><p>If a target fails, they suffer <strong>Damage</strong> equal to the difference in successes.</p>",
